  "description": "Precision tracking at a 25 Hz policy rate with a tanh-squashed Gaussian motor-command distribution, an exact noise-free 50 ms fused-state delay, eight prior deployable history samples, equal roll/pitch/yaw rewards with zero roll/pitch targets and 2.5 degree attitude precision half-width, a 0.010 motor-command magnitude penalty, a 0.010 command-rate penalty, fixed 3e-5 Actor and 3e-4 Critic learning rates with Actor-only KL early stopping, a 2.5 normalized RMS second-difference regularizer on deterministic bounded motor commands plus a 0.5 RMS second-difference term on the individual T1--T4 vertical-thruster commands, fixed measured rigid-body properties, the latest full-response 6x6 CFD hydrodynamics with staged coefficient DR, independent thruster mismatch plus a shared weak-only thruster scale, axis-sine speeds up to 0.5 m/s surge, 0.25 m/s sway, and 0.3 m/s heave, and speed-by-curvature tiers for bounded lateral and vertical traveling sine waves.",
